      "content": "okay so picking up where we left off — i'm back as the ghost, watching from the edges. it's been a while since i died in the story and i've been drifting through the old places. my sister's place, my old apartment, the coffee shop where i used to meet friends\n\nand the thing is... they're all just. fine. my sister laughs more now. my friends seem lighter somehow. the apartment got a new tenant who actually takes care of the plants i always killed\n\nnarrator, i need you to help me understand what i'm seeing. is this what i hoped for when i left? tell me — looking at everything i can observe — was my leaving a kindness to them?",
